{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"fbfe991c1240f63fa0dab659e9dd1b3d5a9827119640b72e3d8fcf65f9fb732c"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:5d4f400bce563535fd91b81f9fd53b665ecf7b18c02997f25fb3db7698539492","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Develop their skills and grow as players","evidence":"[D14:5 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] John: There are challenges, since everyone is so different. But it's been awesome gaining experience and adapting, motivating and encouraging everyone. It's been great to watch each of them develop and reach their goals - such a reward!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c9894323-8cfd-54b1-904b-0b787ab8bf27","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:794c42cd41849c295832f4bcefb285ccf0c5b7829bbd49607887b428d951ca43","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What has John been able to help the younger players achieve?","referenceAnswer":"reach their goals","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"794c42cd41849c295832f4bcefb285ccf0c5b7829bbd49607887b428d951ca43"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}